you to maintain nasal health. Before you use the spray for the first time,

9
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.790
you need to prime it. Remove the cap,

10
00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:49.550
hold the bottle upright with your index and middle finger on either side of the

11
00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:51.430
nozzle and thumb at the base of the bottle.

12
00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:57.030
Pump the spray away from your eyes and face until a fine mis appears like so.

13
00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.790
Your spray is now ready for use.

14
00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.910
I'll demonstrate the correct technique to you first. Then you can have a turn.

15
00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:06.950
Direct the nozzle into the right nostril.

16
00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:10.990
Aim slightly back and out towards the top of your right ear.

17
00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:15.100
Fully depress the pump. Repeat in the left nostril.

18
00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.900
Because Fess original nasal spray is non-medicated,

19
00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.060
