20
00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:26.180
Adults can use two to six sprays per nostril after use.

21
00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:31.180
Wipe the nozzle with a clean, dry tissue and replace the cap. Okay, Sarah,

22
00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:34.940
