23
00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:40.090
Remove the cap, direct the nozzle into the right nostril.

24
00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:45.150
Aim slightly back and out towards the top of your right ear.

25
00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:51.700
Fully depress the pump. Repeat in the left nostril

26
